#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:302
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Anyone can use this nickname once you disconnect. Register it to keep it, and to be recognised in channels that grant access by name."
msgstr ""
"Siapapun dapat menggunakan julukan ini setelah Anda memutuskan. "
"Mendaftarkannya untuk menyimpannya, dan diakui dalam saluran yang memberikan"
" akses dengan nama."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:113
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Claims your current nickname with a NickServ password, so nobody else can use it while you are away."
msgstr ""
"Mengklaim nama panggilan Anda saat ini dengan password NickServ, sehingga "
"tidak ada orang lain dapat menggunakannya saat Anda pergi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:174
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Deletes this nickname registration after you confirm with its password. The nickname stays yours only until you disconnect."
msgstr ""
"Hapus nama panggilan pendaftaran ini setelah Anda mengkonfirmasi dengan "
"password. Nama panggilannya tetap milikmu sampai kau memutuskan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:211
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disconnects a stale session that is still holding a registered nickname, so you can take the nickname back."
msgstr ""
"Mengabaikan sesi basi yang masih memiliki nama panggilan terdaftar, sehingga"
" Anda dapat mengambil julukan kembali."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:209
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ghost session"
msgstr "Sesi hantu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:954
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hands the channel to somebody else. You keep operator status; they get everything that is founder-only, including this tab."
msgstr ""
"Tangan saluran ke orang lain. Anda menjaga status operator; mereka "
"mendapatkan segala sesuatu yang ditemukan - saja, termasuk tab ini."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:891
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How long someone must wait between joins, which is what stops a join flood. Zero turns it off."
msgstr ""
"Berapa lama seseorang harus menunggu antara bergabung, yang adalah apa yang "
"menghentikan banjir bergabung. Zero mematikannya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:739
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How this channel greets people"
msgstr "Bagaimana saluran ini menyapa orang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:889
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Join throttle"
msgstr "Gabungkan throttle"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:288
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "NickServ recognises this session, so the nickname is held for you and channel access lists that name it apply."
msgstr ""
"NickServ mengakui sesi ini, sehingga nama panggilan dipegang untuk Anda dan "
"daftar akses saluran yang diterapkan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:776
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "One line describing what the channel is for. Everyone already in the channel sees it change."
msgstr ""
"Satu baris menjelaskan apa saluran adalah untuk. Semua orang sudah "
"melihatnya berubah."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:952
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ownership"
msgstr "Kepemilikan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/layout/fieldset.ex:92
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Same as"
msgstr "Sama seperti"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:833
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Sent privately to each person the moment they join — the house rules, the link, whatever they need before they speak."
msgstr ""
"Dikirim secara pribadi untuk setiap orang saat mereka bergabung - aturan "
"rumah, link, apa pun yang mereka butuhkan sebelum mereka berbicara."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:295
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The nickname is registered but this session has not proved it owns it. Identify to hold it and to use the access it was granted."
msgstr ""
"Nama panggilan terdaftar tapi sesi ini belum terbukti memilikinya. "
"Identifikasi untuk menahannya dan gunakan akses yang diberikan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:750
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The topic rides above every message for everyone in the channel; the welcome message is written once to each person as they arrive, and nobody else sees it."
msgstr ""
"Topik naik di atas setiap pesan untuk semua orang di saluran; pesan selamat "
"datang ditulis sekali untuk setiap orang saat mereka tiba, dan tidak ada "
"orang lain melihatnya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:108
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This nickname is registered. Enter its NickServ password to prove it is yours — until you do, anyone can take it when you disconnect."
msgstr ""
"Nama panggilan ini terdaftar. Masukkan password NickServ-nya untuk "
"membuktikan itu milikmu - sampai kau melakukannya, semua orang bisa "
"mengambilnya ketika kau memutuskan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:283
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This nickname is taken"
msgstr "Nama panggilan ini diambil"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:284
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This nickname is unclaimed"
msgstr "Nama panggilan ini tidak diketahui"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/account_dialog.ex:282
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This nickname is yours"
msgstr "Nama panggilan ini milikmu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/profile_dialog.ex:106
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A couple of lines about you, up to 200 characters. Everyone can read it; nobody is shown it unless they ask."
msgstr ""
"Beberapa baris tentang Anda, hingga 200 karakter. Semua orang bisa "
"membacanya; tidak ada yang ditampilkan kecuali mereka bertanya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/auto_respond_dialog.ex:132
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of a rule firing in a channel"
msgstr "Miniatur aturan menembak dalam saluran"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/timers_dialog.ex:71
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of a timer firing its command"
msgstr "Miniatur timer menembakkan perintahnya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:290
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the ChanServ record for this channel"
msgstr "Miniatur catatan ChanServ untuk saluran ini"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/trusted_terminals_dialog.ex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the Connect screen listing the machines that log in without a password"
msgstr "Miniatur layar Sambung mendaftarkan mesin yang masuk tanpa sandi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/user_modes_dialog.ex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the Status window these modes deliver to"
msgstr "Miniatur dari jendela Status mode ini dikirimkan ke"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/profile_dialog.ex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the Whois card other people see"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur kartu Whois orang lain melihat"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/perform_dialog.ex:143
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the commands that run on connect"
msgstr "Miniatur perintah yang dijalankan pada koneksi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/autojoin_dialog.ex:124
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the joins that run on connect"
msgstr "Miniatur dari gabungan yang dijalankan pada koneksi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1169
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the masks this list is holding"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur dari topeng daftar ini memegang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the reply somebody messaging you receives"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur jawaban seseorang mengirim pesan Anda menerima"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1008
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of what a newcomer meets at the door"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur apa pendatang baru bertemu di pintu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/alias_dialog.ex:131
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature showing an alias expanding as it is sent"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur menampilkan alias memperluas karena dikirim"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1012
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A mode changes the channel for everybody at once and takes effect the moment you apply it — people already inside are affected too, not just the next person through the door."
msgstr ""
"Mode A mengubah saluran untuk semua orang sekaligus dan mengambil efek saat "
"Anda menerapkannya - orang sudah di dalam juga terpengaruh, bukan hanya "
"orang berikutnya melalui pintu."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/auto_respond_dialog.ex:136
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A rule watches for something happening in a channel and answers with a command. Everyone present sees the answer — it is you talking, not a note to yourself."
msgstr ""
"Aturan mengawasi sesuatu yang terjadi di saluran dan menjawab dengan "
"perintah. Semua orang hadir melihat jawaban - itu adalah Anda berbicara, "
"bukan catatan untuk diri sendiri."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/timers_dialog.ex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A timer sends its command on its own schedule, as if you had typed it. Timers last as long as this session does and are gone when you disconnect."
msgstr ""
"Sebuah timer mengirimkan perintah pada jadwal sendiri, seolah-olah Anda "
"telah mengetik itu. Penghitung waktu berlangsung selama sesi ini tidak dan "
"hilang ketika Anda terputus."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/trusted_terminals_dialog.ex:83
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A trusted terminal is a browser that may take this nickname back without typing the NickServ password. Revoking one makes that browser ask again; ending a session disconnects it now."
msgstr ""
"Terminal terpercaya adalah peramban yang mungkin mengambil nama panggilan "
"ini kembali tanpa mengetik sandi NickServ. Mengcabut satu membuat peramban "
"bertanya lagi; mengakhiri sesi memutuskan hubungan sekarang."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/user_modes_dialog.ex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A user mode applies to your whole connection rather than to one channel, and what it lets through arrives in Status."
msgstr ""
"Mode pengguna berlaku untuk seluruh koneksi Anda daripada ke satu saluran, "
"dan apa yang memungkinkan melalui tiba dalam Status."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/alias_dialog.ex:135
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An alias is a command of your own: type its name and the expansion is what actually runs. Aliases live in this browser and follow no one else."
msgstr ""
"Alias adalah perintah Anda sendiri: ketik namanya dan ekspansi adalah apa "
"yang sebenarnya berjalan. Alias hidup di browser ini dan tidak mengikuti "
"orang lain."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/profile_dialog.ex:104
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Bio"
msgstr "Bio"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/profile_dialog.ex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Both of these show up when somebody runs Whois on you, and nowhere else. The nickname is also what channels grant access to, so changing it can cost you the access the old one had."
msgstr ""
"Kedua ini muncul ketika seseorang menjalankan Whois pada Anda, dan tempat "
"lain. Julukan juga merupakan akses yang diberikan saluran, jadi mengubahnya "
"dapat mengakibatkan akses yang lama."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:288
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "ChanServ"
msgstr "ChanServ"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1382
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "ChanServ is holding this channel"
msgstr "ChanServ memegang saluran ini"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/timers_dialog.ex:65
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Commands that run without you"
msgstr "Perintah yang berjalan tanpa Anda"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/alias_dialog.ex:129
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Composer"
msgstr "Komposer"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/trusted_terminals_dialog.ex:72
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Hubungkan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1173
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each entry is a mask rather than a nickname, so it keeps matching after somebody renames. An exception outranks a ban, which is how you bar a range and still let one person through."
msgstr ""
"Setiap entri adalah topeng daripada nama panggilan, sehingga menjaga "
"pencocokan setelah seseorang mengubah nama. Sebuah pengecualian lebih besar "
"dari larangan, yaitu bagaimana Anda membatasi jangkauan dan masih membiarkan"
" satu orang lewat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/perform_dialog.ex:147
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every line here is sent as if you had typed it, top to bottom, once the connection is up. Turning the list off keeps the lines and runs none of them."
msgstr ""
"Setiap baris di sini dikirim seolah-olah Anda telah diketik itu, atas ke "
"bawah, setelah koneksi terserah. Menyalakan daftar off menjaga garis dan "
"berjalan tidak satupun dari mereka."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/profile_dialog.ex:49
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How you look to other people"
msgstr "Bagaimana Anda melihat orang lain"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Leaving the message empty still marks you away — the reply just says so without a reason."
msgstr ""
"Meninggalkan pesan kosong masih menandai Anda pergi - jawabannya hanya "
"mengatakan begitu tanpa alasan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:48
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/custom_menus_dialog.ex:400
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Query"
msgstr "Query"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:294
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Registering hands the channel to ChanServ, which keeps the founder, the access lists and the settings even when nobody is inside. An unregistered channel stops existing the moment its last member leaves."
msgstr ""
"Mendaftar tangan saluran ke ChanServ, yang membuat pendiri, daftar akses dan"
" pengaturan bahkan ketika tidak ada orang di dalam. Saluran tak terdaftar "
"berhenti ada saat anggota terakhirnya pergi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/user_modes_dialog.ex:103
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Restarting in 5 minutes"
msgstr "Memulai kembali dalam 5 menit"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/alias_dialog.ex:125
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Shorthand you type in the composer"
msgstr "Kependekan Anda ketik komposer"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1163
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The names the door checks"
msgstr "Nama-nama cek pintu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/autojoin_dialog.ex:128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "These channels are joined for you as soon as the connection is up, in this order, before you type anything."
msgstr ""
"Saluran-saluran ini bergabung untuk Anda segera setelah koneksi naik, dalam "
"urutan ini, sebelum Anda mengetik apa-apa."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1383
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This channel is not registered"
msgstr "Saluran ini tidak terdaftar"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/trusted_terminals_dialog.ex:924
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Unnamed terminal"
msgstr "Terminal tak bernama"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/profile_dialog.ex:69
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Up to 16 characters. Taking a registered nickname you cannot identify for will be refused."
msgstr ""
"Sampai 16 karakter. Mengambil nama panggilan terdaftar Anda tidak dapat "
"mengidentifikasi untuk akan ditolak."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/user_modes_dialog.ex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Wallops are the announcements operators send to the whole server — restarts, downtime, anything everybody needs at once."
msgstr ""
"Wallops adalah operator pengumuman yang dikirim ke seluruh server - memulai "
"kembali, downtime, apa pun yang semua orang butuhkan sekaligus."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/autojoin_dialog.ex:118
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What happens the moment you connect"
msgstr "Apa yang terjadi saat Anda menghubungkan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/user_modes_dialog.ex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What reaches your Status window"
msgstr "Apa yang mencapai jendela Status Anda"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/perform_dialog.ex:137
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What runs the moment you connect"
msgstr "What runs the moment you connect"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/auto_respond_dialog.ex:126
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What the room sees you do"
msgstr "What the room sees you do"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/trusted_terminals_dialog.ex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Which machines can skip the password"
msgstr "Mesin mana yang bisa melewatkan kata sandi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "While you are away, anybody who messages you privately gets this back once, and your nickname is marked away in every channel you are in."
msgstr ""
"Saat kau pergi, siapa saja yang mengirim pesan secara pribadi kau "
"mendapatkan ini kembali sekali, dan nama panggilanmu ditandai pergi di "
"setiap saluran dimana kau berada."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1002
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Who gets in, and who gets to talk"
msgstr "Siapa yang masuk, dan siapa yang bisa bicara"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:121
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You are here"
msgstr "Anda di sini"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:120
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You are marked away"
msgstr "Anda ditandai pergi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1365
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "cannot speak"
msgstr "tidak dapat berbicara"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1391
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "founder"
msgstr "pendiri"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1371
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "hello everyone"
msgstr "Halo semuanya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:126
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:130
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "hey, got a minute?"
msgstr "Hei, punya waktu sebentar?"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1359
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "invite only"
msgstr "Hanya undangan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/channel_central_dialog.ex:1358
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "cannot join"
msgstr "tidak dapat bergabung"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/away_dialog.ex:131
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "is away"
msgstr "jauh"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/auto_respond_dialog.ex:378
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "somebody joined"
msgstr "seseorang bergabung"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/auto_respond_dialog.ex:379
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "somebody left"
msgstr "seseorang kiri"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/auto_respond_dialog.ex:380
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "something happened"
msgstr "sesuatu terjadi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/timers_dialog.ex:353
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "timer %{name} fired"
msgstr "timer %{name} dipecat"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:443
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{nick}, got a second?"
msgstr "%{nick}, punya waktu sebentar?"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/nick_colors_dialog.ex:71
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A colour set here follows the nickname everywhere it appears — the list beside the room and every line they write. It is yours alone; nobody else sees the colour you picked."
msgstr ""
"Set warna di sini mengikuti julukan di mana-mana muncul - daftar di samping "
"ruangan dan setiap baris yang mereka tulis. Ini adalah milikmu sendiri; "
"tidak ada orang lain melihat warna yang Anda pilih."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:144
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A highlight paints the whole line and can sound the highlight alert, so the message finds you in a channel you are not reading. Your own nickname counts without being on the list."
msgstr ""
"Sorot yang menggambarkan seluruh baris dan suara peringatan sorot, sehingga "
"pesan menemukan Anda dalam saluran yang tidak Anda baca. Nama panggilan Anda"
" sendiri menghitung tanpa berada di daftar."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/sound_settings_dialog.ex:178
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature listing the events that currently play a sound"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur daftar peristiwa yang saat ini memainkan suara"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:140
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of a channel line matching a highlight word"
msgstr "Miniatur dari suatu baris saluran yang cocok dengan kata penyorotan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/flood_protection_dialog.ex:106
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of a flood being cut off at the threshold"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur banjir sedang terputus di ambang pintu"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/custom_menus_dialog.ex:139
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the context menu these entries are added to"
msgstr "Miniatur menu konteks entri ini ditambahkan ke"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/nick_colors_dialog.ex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the nickname list with these colours applied"
msgstr "Miniatur daftar nama panggilan dengan warna-warna ini diterapkan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/sound_settings_dialog.ex:183
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each event can play a sound, flash the taskbar, or raise a desktop notification. All of it is per browser: the same nickname on another machine is silent until you set it there too."
msgstr ""
"Setiap event dapat memainkan suara, flash taskbar, atau menaikkan "
"pemberitahuan desktop. Semua itu adalah per browser: julukan yang sama pada "
"mesin lain diam sampai Anda mengaturnya juga."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/custom_menus_dialog.ex:144
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Entries are appended below what the menu already offers — they never replace a built-in. Each one runs its command against whatever you right-clicked."
msgstr ""
"Entri ditambahkan di bawah apa yang menu sudah menawarkan - mereka tidak "
"pernah mengganti built-in sebuah. Masing-masing menjalankan perintah "
"terhadap apa pun yang Anda benar-benar diklik."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/nick_colors_dialog.ex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How names read in the list and the log"
msgstr "Bagaimana nama dibaca dalam daftar dan log"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:134
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lines that will come looking for you"
msgstr "Baris yang akan datang mencari Anda"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/sound_settings_dialog.ex:175
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Makes a sound"
msgstr "Membuat suara"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/nick_colors_dialog.ex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Nicknames"
msgstr "Nama panggilan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/custom_menus_dialog.ex:136
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Right-click"
msgstr "Klik kanan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/flood_protection_dialog.ex:110
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "These limits apply to everybody in every channel and private conversation on this server. Somebody who crosses one is silenced for the cooldown, not disconnected."
msgstr ""
"Batas-batas ini berlaku untuk semua orang di setiap saluran dan percakapan "
"pribadi di server ini. Seseorang yang melintasi satu dibungkam untuk "
"pendinginan, tidak terputus."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/flood_protection_dialog.ex:100
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What happens when somebody floods"
msgstr "Apa yang terjadi ketika seseorang banjir"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/sound_settings_dialog.ex:171
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What this browser will make a noise about"
msgstr "Apa browser ini akan membuat kebisingan tentang"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/custom_menus_dialog.ex:132
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What your right-click menu will hold"
msgstr "Apa menu right- klik Anda akan terus"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:429
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:436
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/ignore_list_dialog.ex:275
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "anyone around?"
msgstr "Ada orang di sekitar sini?"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/flood_protection_dialog.ex:255
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "line %{index}"
msgstr "baris %{index}"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:445
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "your nickname, got a second?"
msgstr "nama panggilanmu, ada waktu?"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/highlight_dialog.ex:437
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "…about %{word} again"
msgstr "... tentang %{word} lagi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/flood_protection_dialog.ex:261
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "muted after %{count} lines in %{window} seconds"
msgstr "dibisukan setelah %{count} baris dalam %{window} detik"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/url_catcher.ex:357
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{nick} posted"
msgstr "%{nick} membagikan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/ignore_list_dialog.ex:276
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{nick} — hidden"
msgstr "%{nick} - tersembunyi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/address_book.ex:73
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A contact is yours alone: the nickname, the colour you gave it and your own note. Nobody is told you added them, and nothing here reaches the server they see."
msgstr ""
"Kontak adalah milikmu sendiri: nama panggilan, warna yang Anda berikan dan "
"catatan Anda sendiri. Tidak ada yang diberitahu Anda menambahkan mereka, dan"
" tidak ada di sini mencapai server yang mereka lihat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/mentions_dialog.ex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A mention is recorded whenever somebody writes your nickname in a channel you had joined, whether or not the window was open. Opening one takes you to the line in its own conversation."
msgstr ""
"Sebuah penyebutan direkam setiap kali seseorang menulis nama panggilan Anda "
"dalam saluran yang Anda telah bergabung, apakah atau tidak jendela terbuka. "
"Membuka satu membawa Anda ke baris dalam percakapan sendiri."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/mentions_dialog.ex:60
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of a channel line naming you"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur dari garis saluran bernama Anda"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/ignore_list_dialog.ex:60
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of a channel with an ignored line withheld"
msgstr "Miniatur kanal dengan baris yang diabaikan ditahan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/saved_dialog.ex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of a kept line and where it came from"
msgstr "Miniatur dari garis yang disimpan dan dari mana asalnya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/notify_list.ex:129
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the Status notice a tracked nickname produces"
msgstr ""
"Miniatur pemberitahuan Status yang dilacak menghasilkan nama panggilan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/address_book.ex:69
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the card a contact is read on"
msgstr "Miniatur kartu kontak dibaca pada"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/url_catcher.ex:136
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the message a caught link came from"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur pesan link tertangkap berasal dari"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/pinned_dialog.ex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A miniature of the room wearing its pinned line"
msgstr "Sebuah miniatur ruangan mengenakan garis tempelnya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/pinned_dialog.ex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A pin belongs to the channel, not to you: everybody sees the same one, and an operator is the only one who can put a line up here or take it down."
msgstr ""
"Sebuah pin milik saluran, bukan untuk Anda: semua orang melihat yang sama, "
"dan operator adalah satu-satunya yang dapat menempatkan garis di sini atau "
"menurunkannya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/ignore_list_dialog.ex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An ignored person still speaks and everyone else still reads them — the lines simply never reach your screen. They are not told, and it holds in channels and private messages alike."
msgstr ""
"Orang yang diabaikan masih berbicara dan orang lain masih membacanya - garis"
" tidak pernah mencapai layar Anda. Mereka tidak diberitahu, dan memegang "
"dalam saluran dan pesan pribadi."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/url_catcher.ex:140
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every link anybody posts is collected here as it goes by, so a URL you scrolled past is still findable. The list lives in this browser and holds a fixed number before the oldest drops off."
msgstr ""
"Setiap link setiap posting siapa pun dikumpulkan di sini saat berlalu, "
"sehingga URL yang Anda scrolling masa lalu masih dapat ditemukan. Daftar "
"tinggal di browser ini dan memegang nomor tetap sebelum tertua turun."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/notify_list.ex:122
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How you find out somebody arrived"
msgstr "Bagaimana Anda menemukan seseorang tiba"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/mentions_dialog.ex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lines that named you while you were away"
msgstr "Baris yang bernama Anda saat Anda sedang pergi"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/saved_dialog.ex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lines you decided to keep"
msgstr "Garis Anda memutuskan untuk menjaga"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/url_catcher.ex:130
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Links picked out of what was said"
msgstr "Links memilih dari apa yang dikatakan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/saved_dialog.ex:60
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Tersimpan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/saved_dialog.ex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Saving keeps a copy for you alone — nobody is told, and the line stays here even if the conversation it came from is gone. Opening one takes you back to where it was said."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan salinan untuk Anda sendiri - tidak ada yang diberitahu, dan garis "
"tetap di sini bahkan jika percakapan itu berasal dari hilang. Membuka satu "
"membawa Anda kembali ke tempat itu dikatakan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/address_book.ex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The people you keep a note on"
msgstr "Orang-orang Anda menyimpan catatan pada"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/notify_list.ex:134
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tracking somebody writes a line to Status the moment they connect, whether or not you share a channel with them. They are never told they are on the list."
msgstr ""
"Melacak seseorang menulis baris ke Status saat mereka terhubung, apakah Anda"
" berbagi saluran dengan mereka. Mereka tidak pernah diberitahu mereka berada"
" dalam daftar."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/pinned_dialog.ex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What the channel keeps above everything"
msgstr "Apa saluran terus di atas segalanya"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/ignore_list_dialog.ex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What you stop being shown"
msgstr "Apa yang Anda berhenti ditampilkan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/address_book.ex:372
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
